{"t_ms": 1739031, "conversation_id": "conv_sentence_end_s1_043", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Wi-Fi Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nComplimentary high-speed Wi-Fi is available throughout the hotel for all registered guests. Guests can connect using the network GrandHorizon_Guest and enter the access credentials provided during check-in. For technical assistance or connectivity issues, guests may contact the Front Desk at any time.", "# corpus/ \u2014 Hotel Documents\n\n**Owner: Lakshya**\n\n## What this folder is\n\nThe hotel's documents live here: the knowledge the assistant answers from. About 60 short \ndocuments covering things like pool and gym hours, check-in and check-out rules, menus, and \npolicies.\n\n## How to fill it\n\nSee the full instructions in `retrieval/README.md` (Step 1). In short:\n- Write ~60 short documents, one topic per file, as `.txt` or `.md`.\n- Make them realistic and varied.\n- Deliberately plant a few contradictions (e.g. one doc says the pool closes at 10 PM, \n  another says 9 PM) and keep a note of which ones, for a later experiment.\n\nThe index-building script reads every file in this folder, so anything you put here becomes \npart of the searchable knowledge.\n", "Room Amenities Guide\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nEvery guest room is equipped with complimentary Wi-Fi, air conditioning, a smart television, electronic safe, telephone, minibar, tea and coffee-making facilities, bottled drinking water, premium toiletries, fresh towels, and a hairdryer. Additional amenities such as an iron, ironing board, or extra pillows can be requested through housekeeping."], "scores": [0.7652827501296997, 0.8762212991714478, 0.8804077506065369], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 1369, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
